<title>UK: Achmea Hypo sets 9.5 bln escudo zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>Achmea Hypo sets 9.5 bln escudo zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banco Cisf.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ACMEA HYPOTHEEKBANK</p>
<p> AMT    9.5 BLN PTE   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    29.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  53.222    PAY DATE    30.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 100	 GOV LAW     DUTCH</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		SECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
